        "TileImage": "$($repository 2a9ac690-b61d-4b03-976a-603ba186fdb5).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47, We have discovered a network of undercover spies, rouge hitmen, and terrorists. They are all connected in the way they hide themselves, posing as chefs wherever they go. Members of this syndicate have stolen, killed, and frauded many prominent figures around the globe. You have been contracted to eliminate any and all members of this syndicate to ensure they will stop wreaking havoc. Two more members have been spotted trying to poison tourists. Take them down.",
